# Each team owns its own sources; the platform team owns the module, the root configuration, and the workflow. GitHub
# requires an owner's review before a change to their paths can merge (with branch protection's "require review from
# Code Owners" on).
*                    @acme/platform
/teams/payments/     @acme/payments-leads
/teams/finance/      @acme/finance-leads
# Who's onboarded (each team.yaml) and who gets in (org.yaml) are the platform team's to approve. Last match wins,
# so these come after the teams' own folders.
/teams/*/team.yaml   @acme/platform
/org.yaml            @acme/platform
